[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2161.73, "timestamp": "00:36:01", "text": "我还会再来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2167.51, "timestamp": "00:36:07", "text": "哦，天哪。所以这实际上是有道理的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2170.23, "timestamp": "00:36:10", "text": "我要斩杀吸血鬼和邪恶势力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2173.51, "timestamp": "00:36:13", "text": "生物。我喜欢最高分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2177.51, "timestamp": "00:36:17", "text": "我就像个最棒的人，然后就出发了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2181.19, "timestamp": "00:36:21", "text": "等等，我心想：我的天哪，他的英语"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2184.41, "timestamp": "00:36:24", "text": "彻底坏掉了。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2186.55, "timestamp": "00:36:26", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2188.57, "timestamp": "00:36:28", "text": "H"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2190.31, "timestamp": "00:36:30", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2192.63, "timestamp": "00:36:32", "text": "呃，邪恶。好的，我们来玩“漂亮站立”游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2195.43, "timestamp": "00:36:35", "text": "对我来说，当我滑倒的次数越来越少时，就会滑倒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2196.87, "timestamp": "00:36:36", "text": "并损失一些。所以，我有点害怕"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2200.55, "timestamp": "00:36:40", "text": "照做。我真的很差劲。你打赌了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2203.03, "timestamp": "00:36:43", "text": "你必须把所有技能都运用到如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2205.91, "timestamp": "00:36:45", "text": "我们几乎不会说话。我觉得自己学到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2209.99, "timestamp": "00:36:49", "text": "这次很多。好吧，确实如此。我们现在位于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2211.22, "timestamp": "00:36:51", "text": "5.84"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2213.589, "timestamp": "00:36:53", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2215.589, "timestamp": "00:36:55", "text": "粉丝。好的。那很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2217.67, "timestamp": "00:36:57", "text": "关闭"}]